WEBVTT

00:04.270 --> 00:07.440
The shining time...

00:08.610 --> 00:16.160
...I have always imagined.

00:25.120 --> 00:30.250
Something will change tomorrow.

00:32.340 --> 00:38.640
I can sense it.

00:39.810 --> 00:46.940
In a mirage, I wait until you come.

00:47.190 --> 00:54.860
I walk briskly through the brightly lit streets.

00:55.780 --> 01:01.870
You've run so far.

01:02.950 --> 01:10.130
So I felt the air of your love.

01:10.340 --> 01:16.340
Soon after I see you,

01:17.680 --> 01:23.640
my stolen heart beats.

01:44.290 --> 01:46.370
How's the view?

01:46.370 --> 01:48.620
Hmm... It's beautiful.

01:48.620 --> 01:54.130
With a height of 120 meters, it's the tallest building in our city.

01:54.130 --> 01:56.130
I see, I see.

01:56.130 --> 01:59.470
The night view is also quite beautiful.

01:59.470 --> 02:00.760
I would think so.

02:07.730 --> 02:10.980
The Music Box Museum is at the bottom of the tower.

02:16.940 --> 02:19.660
This is very impressive.

02:19.660 --> 02:21.240
Wow... Amazing.

02:22.530 --> 02:24.660
This is the grand opening's anniversary item.

02:24.660 --> 02:29.790
A music box, given to us by an English prince, is the main attraction of the museum.

02:29.790 --> 02:32.170
It's valued at 10 million dollars.

02:32.170 --> 02:33.210
And?

02:34.250 --> 02:38.670
A-And naturally. we have guards to protect it, in case of the unexpected.

02:38.670 --> 02:42.600
The unexpected? Such as Jeanne?

02:47.100 --> 02:48.270
Toudaiji-kun...

02:49.230 --> 02:52.900
Up until now, how many times have you failed to catch Jeanne?

02:56.110 --> 02:57.860
Eleven times.

02:57.860 --> 02:59.400
How many items were stolen?

02:59.400 --> 03:01.030
Eleven.

03:01.030 --> 03:02.780
Any clues to her identity?

03:02.780 --> 03:04.780
None at the moment...

03:04.780 --> 03:06.990
That doesn't sound good.

03:06.990 --> 03:08.660
I'm very sorry.

03:08.660 --> 03:10.660
My superiors are asking me...

03:10.660 --> 03:12.460
...what's going on.

03:13.580 --> 03:16.340
If this continues, I'll be held responsible...

03:16.340 --> 03:18.880
...since I was the one who made you Chief Detective.

03:24.930 --> 03:31.560
Detective Family! The Last Gamble

03:35.650 --> 03:38.320
Oh! It's okay Maron-chan, leave it to me.

03:38.650 --> 03:40.990
WHAT DO YOU MEAN "FIRED?!"

03:40.990 --> 03:43.110
Miyako, you don't have to scream it out loud.

03:43.110 --> 03:44.530
But...

03:44.530 --> 03:46.910
It's not like he said that directly...

03:46.910 --> 03:49.660
But it still means you're getting fired, right?

03:52.250 --> 03:54.170
<i>Toudaiji-kun...</i>

03:54.170 --> 04:00.130
<i>If you fail one more time to arrest Jeanne, I'll have to do something about it...</i>

04:03.720 --> 04:05.470
Speaking of the Chief,

04:05.470 --> 04:10.060
has he forgotten how successful Dad has been in the past?!

04:11.020 --> 04:14.810
However, I've always failed when it's come to Jeanne.

04:16.270 --> 04:18.770
There's nothing wrong with you...

04:18.770 --> 04:20.570
...it's just that Jeanne is really strong.

04:20.570 --> 04:23.400
Maron, that's not helping anyone.

04:24.410 --> 04:28.120
In the worst case, I probably won't be able to enjoy my whisky anymore.

04:28.120 --> 04:30.120
Don't feel down.

04:30.120 --> 04:32.790
Even if that happens, everything will work out.

04:39.840 --> 04:43.340
Dad's pretty sensitive.

04:43.340 --> 04:47.800
He doesn't get enough sleep whenever Jeanne sends a notice card.

04:47.800 --> 04:51.890
But I think there are jobs suitable for your dad...

04:51.890 --> 04:54.520
...such as a normal officer or a bodyguard...

04:54.520 --> 04:56.730
Are you suggesting that he should quit being a detective?

04:56.730 --> 05:00.110
But, it's wrong for him to accept all the responsibility for catching a criminal.

05:00.110 --> 05:01.610
Doesn't he get tired of it?

05:01.610 --> 05:03.070
Yeah, but...

05:03.070 --> 05:07.030
The Chief will realize that he made a mistake if your dad quits.

05:07.030 --> 05:08.030
I guess so...

05:08.030 --> 05:10.120
He should!

05:10.120 --> 05:12.700
We don't need to wait until he gets fired.

05:14.080 --> 05:16.670
<i>If Miyako and her dad are out of the picture...</i>

05:16.670 --> 05:20.090
<i>...it'll be much easier to "Checkmate."</i>

05:20.090 --> 05:22.210
Checkmate!

05:25.670 --> 05:27.720
Nothing bad will come of it.

05:27.720 --> 05:28.680
But, no.

05:28.680 --> 05:29.850
Why?

05:33.390 --> 05:36.060
My dream is to become a detective...

05:36.060 --> 05:41.980
...and to solve mystery after mystery with my dad.

05:41.980 --> 05:46.490
That's why I don't want him to quit!

05:46.490 --> 05:47.450
Understand?

05:47.450 --> 05:48.740
I get it...

05:59.420 --> 06:01.670
What are we doing this early in the morning?

06:01.670 --> 06:03.090
It's simple.

06:03.090 --> 06:09.970
We're going to tell that blockhead Chief how superior my dad is.

06:09.970 --> 06:11.850
Then, why do I have to go with you?

06:11.850 --> 06:14.270
You're my next-door neighbor, right?

06:14.270 --> 06:15.560
Yeah.

06:15.560 --> 06:17.850
You, as a neighbor, are going to tell how my dad...

06:17.850 --> 06:24.070
...is an excellent, superior, cool and sharp detective.

06:24.070 --> 06:24.900
Huh?

06:24.900 --> 06:27.860
<i>I'm gonna be late for work!!</i>

06:28.530 --> 06:31.820
Cool... Superior... Excellent...

06:31.820 --> 06:36.120
It's: "Excellent, superior, cool and sharp detective."

06:36.120 --> 06:37.910
Keep working on it.

06:37.910 --> 06:38.500
Okay...

06:44.460 --> 06:47.840
Excellent and...superior...and...

06:56.890 --> 06:59.140
I understand.

06:59.140 --> 07:02.270
Exactly. Toudaiji Himuro is a superior...

07:02.270 --> 07:06.070
...and excellent and cold... I mean cool detective.

07:06.070 --> 07:08.280
You two are Miyako-chan and Maron-chan, right?

07:08.280 --> 07:09.280
Yes.

07:09.280 --> 07:11.820
Hm... It's hard for me, too...

07:11.820 --> 07:17.200
However, I cannot disobey orders from the higher authorities.

07:17.200 --> 07:18.750
But that's why...

07:18.750 --> 07:22.670
I'm the one who is most disappointed.

07:22.670 --> 07:25.750
I was expecting a great deal out of Toudaiji-kun.

07:25.750 --> 07:28.550
My father is the only one who will be able to catch Jeanne!

07:28.550 --> 07:32.010
But he has failed many times.

07:32.010 --> 07:33.760
I can't cover for him.

07:34.760 --> 07:39.140
I had fun, talking with two pretty girls...

07:39.140 --> 07:43.150
Even though it was about Toudaiji-kun's plans.

07:43.150 --> 07:44.730
Goodbye.

07:46.440 --> 07:49.110
You inflexible, blockheaded...

07:49.110 --> 07:50.400
- Miyako!

07:49.110 --> 07:50.950
- Let me go, Maron!!

07:50.400 --> 07:52.450
Calm down!

07:54.450 --> 07:55.820
Miyako-san?

07:58.160 --> 07:59.750
Here you go.

07:59.750 --> 08:01.790
Typical of men...

08:03.620 --> 08:06.920
It's hopelessly filthy in here! When did you last clean?

08:06.920 --> 08:07.960
Last month, I think.

08:15.590 --> 08:18.600
The detective is at headquarters right now.

08:18.600 --> 08:21.680
I know. That's why I came.

08:21.680 --> 08:25.310
You don't need to worry about what the Chief said.

08:25.310 --> 08:28.570
All you need to do is catch Jeanne.

08:28.570 --> 08:29.730
That's right.

08:29.730 --> 08:34.910
We don't want to even think about working under anyone but Detective Toudaiji.

08:34.910 --> 08:37.870
But what happens if he really does get fired?

08:37.870 --> 08:41.620
I-Idiot! Don't say things like that!

08:41.620 --> 08:44.920
But still, I feel very uneasy.

08:47.460 --> 08:51.300
Come on! Aren't you guys supposed to be...

08:51.300 --> 08:54.260
...members of the Jeanne Special Task Force?

08:54.840 --> 08:58.140
No one needs a timid and inefficient detective!

08:58.140 --> 09:01.350
Anyway, if you have so much time to feel depressed,

09:01.350 --> 09:03.480
it's better spent investigating!

09:03.810 --> 09:05.980
Yes, ma'am!

09:11.150 --> 09:16.700
Who cares about one, two, ten or even hundreds of mistakes?

09:18.200 --> 09:20.830
Maron, don't you agree?

09:20.830 --> 09:21.830
Uh, yeah...

09:23.040 --> 09:23.870
Why you...!

09:25.750 --> 09:27.670
If my dad is not a detective...

09:32.550 --> 09:34.590
...he won't be the same Dad I know.

09:35.090 --> 09:38.590
Dad can't quit! I won't let him!

09:39.970 --> 09:41.060
Miyako...

09:44.600 --> 09:46.350
What do you think I should do?

09:47.520 --> 09:49.190
Is it my fault?

09:49.190 --> 09:50.940
No, not at all.

09:51.770 --> 09:53.070
It'll be all right.

09:53.070 --> 09:55.490
Maron, you're not a very good liar.

09:56.320 --> 09:59.530
I've never thought of being anything but a detective.

10:08.210 --> 10:13.500
Yo! Where were...

10:10.330 --> 10:13.500
ah...

10:11.540 --> 10:13.500
um...

10:12.670 --> 10:13.500
oh...?

10:20.800 --> 10:24.890
Sinbad! Big news! I have big news!

10:24.890 --> 10:26.230
...What's wrong?

10:27.020 --> 10:28.230
What's that?

10:33.690 --> 10:36.150
Miyako, cheer up, okay?

10:36.150 --> 10:38.820
Well, see you tomorrow! Good night!

10:38.820 --> 10:39.820
Good night...

10:47.620 --> 10:48.500
Fin!

10:48.500 --> 10:49.460
Hmph!

10:49.460 --> 10:50.870
What are you mad about?

10:50.870 --> 10:53.670
Maron! What were you doing all day?!

10:53.670 --> 10:55.750
Well, I was with Miyako.

10:55.750 --> 10:58.760
You should have told me where you were going.

10:58.760 --> 11:02.760
Sorry, but you weren't here when I called you.

11:03.300 --> 11:04.470
Out for a little night fun?

11:05.310 --> 11:09.810
I was doing what I was supposed to be doing! I found a new Demon!

11:09.810 --> 11:10.730
What?!

11:10.730 --> 11:13.900
You know the Music Box Museum that just opened?

11:15.900 --> 11:19.400
I left the notice card. The rest is up to you.

11:21.490 --> 11:23.490
Is it possible to cancel the notice?

11:23.490 --> 11:24.740
Maron!!

11:29.790 --> 11:31.830
Miyako! Don't scare me like that!

11:31.830 --> 11:34.840
A notice card arrived from Jeanne.

11:34.840 --> 11:36.710
All right!

11:38.420 --> 11:45.760
This time I'll arrest Jeanne and spread the name of Toudaiji all over the world.

11:46.350 --> 11:48.930
Notice

11:46.350 --> 11:48.930
Don't go away!

11:46.350 --> 11:48.930
I'll return right after these messages!

11:46.350 --> 11:48.930
Kaitou Jeanne

11:49.890 --> 11:52.520
Notice

11:49.890 --> 11:52.520
I'm back to continue my adventures

11:49.890 --> 11:52.520
Kaitou Jeanne

12:02.360 --> 12:05.450
Mom, did you put out the best knives and forks?

12:05.450 --> 12:08.740
Of course. Can you set up the candles?

12:09.240 --> 12:11.370
Oh no! The chicken will burn!

12:18.420 --> 12:19.210
How is it?

12:19.210 --> 12:22.800
Looks great! It'll be a beautiful party!

12:22.800 --> 12:25.970
Why are you having a party?

12:25.970 --> 12:29.510
If the worst happens, we may not be able to eat like this anymore.

12:29.510 --> 12:33.140
So, I thought we should have one last extravagant meal.

12:33.140 --> 12:35.600
Hey, Mom, let's set the table.

12:35.600 --> 12:37.230
All right.

12:39.110 --> 12:40.190
Oh, they're here!

12:41.240 --> 12:42.570
I'm ho--

12:42.570 --> 12:43.110
Yo.

12:43.110 --> 12:45.070
Excuse us!

12:45.070 --> 12:46.700
I brought you a cake.

12:46.700 --> 12:49.540
Why, thank you. Please have a seat.

12:51.040 --> 12:52.200
What a feast!

12:52.200 --> 12:53.540
I know I'll eat my fill!

13:00.880 --> 13:03.800
All right! I'll do a good job!

13:03.800 --> 13:07.140
Then, when Miyako-chan and her father retire...

13:07.140 --> 13:10.140
...we can <i>Checkmate</i> with ease!

13:24.320 --> 13:27.490
I told your mother about the notice card.

13:27.490 --> 13:28.910
As a sign of you giving up?

13:28.910 --> 13:33.120
Well... Then she said that we'd have a party.

13:33.120 --> 13:38.500
Yeah, she made me go buy the best meat in the market, and told me to invite Maron-chan as well.

13:39.580 --> 13:43.550
She's trying to encourage us in her own way.

13:43.550 --> 13:45.510
Yeah, I know.

13:50.680 --> 13:53.220
I heard you came to the office today.

13:53.220 --> 13:54.890
Huh? Oh, yeah...

13:55.770 --> 14:03.320
The reason I became a detective wasn't to become famous or earn money...

14:03.320 --> 14:06.400
...but because I couldn't forgive the evil in this world.

14:08.410 --> 14:14.290
If Jeanne is evil, then it is my job to stop her.

14:15.250 --> 14:17.790
Dad... I'm sorry.

14:19.880 --> 14:20.790
What's wrong?

14:20.790 --> 14:22.340
Dad!

14:22.340 --> 14:24.760
H...Hey, Miyako!

14:29.590 --> 14:31.090
Don't cry.

14:31.090 --> 14:35.680
Hey, don't blow your nose! Mom, get Miyako a tissue!

14:44.400 --> 14:45.940
Maron...

14:45.940 --> 14:50.990
Maron, you know what the most important thing is, don't you?

14:50.990 --> 14:52.700
I have no other option but to do it.

15:07.050 --> 15:15.930
<i>The only one who can seal the Demons hiding in beautiful things, is you, the reincarnation of Jeanne d'Arc, Maron.</i>

15:46.710 --> 15:48.710
It's time. Let's go, Fin.

15:48.710 --> 15:50.130
Okay.

16:09.110 --> 16:12.280
Maron, it's up to you. Do your best!

16:13.450 --> 16:14.740
We're ready.

16:14.740 --> 16:16.870
All right. Proceed to your positions.

16:16.870 --> 16:17.700
Yes, sir!

16:18.990 --> 16:21.790
Are you really going to catch Jeanne this time?

16:21.790 --> 16:23.580
I can't promise I will.

16:23.580 --> 16:24.620
Toudaiji-kun...

16:24.620 --> 16:27.340
But I will do the best that I can.

16:27.340 --> 16:31.720
I, Toudaiji Himuro, will protect the music box, even if it means sacrificing my life.

16:34.930 --> 16:37.350
<i>Jeanne d'Arc, lend me your power.</i>

16:37.350 --> 16:43.940
Piece of Love... The shining time...

16:44.640 --> 16:46.310
<i>Strong and serious...</i>

16:45.020 --> 16:52.320
...I have always imagined.

16:46.310 --> 16:48.230
<i>Matchless and marvelous...</i>

16:48.230 --> 16:49.820
<i>Energetic and courageous!</i>

16:52.780 --> 16:55.110
It's Jeanne! Jeanne has appeared!

16:55.110 --> 16:55.860
Where?

16:55.860 --> 16:58.620
To the right of the entrance!

17:01.620 --> 17:06.830
Something will change tomorrow.

17:08.790 --> 17:15.300
I can sense it.

17:15.300 --> 17:16.430
Stop!

17:16.430 --> 17:23.640
In a mirage, I wait until you come.<i></i>

17:18.010 --> 17:19.760
<i>She passed the entrance!</i>

17:23.640 --> 17:31.570
I walk briskly through the brightly lit streets.<i></i>

17:30.320 --> 17:32.320
You took your time, Jeanne.

17:32.320 --> 17:39.280
You've run so far.<i></i>

17:36.570 --> 17:38.160
Don't get in my way!

17:38.160 --> 17:39.660
What if I do?

17:39.280 --> 17:46.710
So I felt the air of your love.<i></i>

17:39.660 --> 17:40.280
I'll defeat you.

17:44.540 --> 17:46.500
Jeanne, can you win against me?

17:46.500 --> 17:48.420
I hate talkative men!

17:46.710 --> 17:53.130
Soon after I see you,<i></i>

17:51.840 --> 17:54.670
Sinbad, I won't forgive you if you get in my way.

17:54.050 --> 18:00.550
my stolen heart beats.<i></i>

18:01.720 --> 18:03.770
I... I've got you!

18:04.520 --> 18:07.480
J-Jeanne, give it up!

18:17.280 --> 18:21.070
I was waiting for you, Jeanne. I won't let you go any further!

18:21.870 --> 18:23.740
If that's the way you want to do it...

18:24.540 --> 18:25.790
I guess I have to fight.

18:26.870 --> 18:28.160
I won't go easy on you.

18:28.790 --> 18:30.000
You can't win!

18:42.050 --> 18:43.180
I've got you, Jeanne!

18:43.180 --> 18:44.060
Do you really?

18:46.100 --> 18:48.850
What's this?! H-Hey! Get me down!

18:51.150 --> 18:53.570
I can't stop now!

18:58.950 --> 18:59.910
It's gone...

19:01.200 --> 19:02.320
Oji-sama...? (The detective)

19:15.000 --> 19:17.460
Stop, Detective Toudaiji!

19:18.380 --> 19:20.430
I'll take the music box!

19:20.430 --> 19:21.430
I refuse!

19:21.430 --> 19:23.140
Then I'll just take it by force!

19:51.750 --> 19:52.670
DAD!!!

19:52.670 --> 19:53.330
Toudaiji-kun!

19:58.130 --> 19:59.800
Dad...

20:10.640 --> 20:11.690
A Demon?!

20:16.480 --> 20:18.480
Rebound Ball, come out.

20:28.330 --> 20:29.540
I won't let you get away!

20:33.960 --> 20:37.290
<i>Why, you!!!</i>

20:37.750 --> 20:39.460
In the name of God...

20:39.460 --> 20:41.300
You, a Demon, born in darkness...

20:41.300 --> 20:42.670
I seal you here!

20:43.300 --> 20:44.510
<i>Checkmate!</i>

21:00.860 --> 21:02.190
<i>Collection completed!</i>

21:11.080 --> 21:13.080
I'm so glad you're safe, Dad!

21:14.250 --> 21:15.580
Toudaiji-kun...

21:16.210 --> 21:20.090
I am very sorry for letting her get away.

21:20.090 --> 21:22.340
I'm ready to accept any consequences.

21:22.340 --> 21:24.720
You did a great job out there.

21:24.720 --> 21:29.300
That energy, that spirit! You fulfilled my expectations of you!

21:29.300 --> 21:30.390
Ch... Chief!

21:30.390 --> 21:32.680
You're the only one who can arrest Jeanne!

21:33.390 --> 21:37.690
Well, the people at headquarters wouldn't complain if they saw you in action!

21:37.690 --> 21:39.400
You're a hero!

21:39.400 --> 21:41.860
A hero?!

21:41.860 --> 21:45.780
Toudaiji-kun, you will still work for us, won't you?

21:45.780 --> 21:46.650
Yes, sir!

21:51.660 --> 21:52.540
Jeanne...

22:01.420 --> 22:04.970
Adieu!

22:05.470 --> 22:11.300
For billions of years,

22:11.390 --> 22:20.860
it kept infinite thoughts.

22:23.020 --> 22:29.490
It wakens the memory of the distant past.

22:29.740 --> 22:35.790
A life born in the wild ocean.

22:36.410 --> 22:39.210
The huge mountains...

22:41.920 --> 22:48.840
...emitted white smoke and covered the Sun.

22:49.340 --> 22:53.890
It took everything.

22:56.140 --> 23:02.110
On the deserted land with you,

23:02.190 --> 23:09.110
we watched the world ending...

23:09.320 --> 23:15.160
Someday we'll go beyond space-time...

23:15.290 --> 23:24.960
and I'll wish to meet you again.

23:32.180 --> 23:35.560
Is that boy the young, genius pianist that Fin was talking about?

23:35.560 --> 23:39.810
Yes, he has a beautiful heart that enables him to come up with such beautiful melodies...

23:39.810 --> 23:43.980
He'll be targeted by a Demon for sure! Please protect him!

23:43.980 --> 23:46.230
Fin?! You aren't in love with him, are you?

23:46.230 --> 23:49.280
- It's nothing like that...

23:47.940 --> 23:49.280
- You're blushing...

23:49.280 --> 23:51.860
I don't like you, Maron!

23:51.860 --> 23:55.330
Kamikaze Kaitou Jeanne: Steal the Melody of Love!

23:55.330 --> 23:59.950
It's impossible for me, an Angel, to fall in love with a human.
